WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.680
Mint once, deploy everywhere. Meet the new UNCX Token Minter, the first no-code tool that lets

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.800
you mint a token across multiple chains in a single transaction. Powered by Hyperlane, it's

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:19.080
interoperable by default. One mint, multiple chains. It's as simple as selecting your base

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:28.600
chain, filling out your token details, and executing a mint. Once confirmed, the token

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.640
is registered across supported chains instantly. Supported chains include Base, BNB Chain, Ethereum,

00:00:34.640 --> 00:00:40.680
Sei, Arbitrum, Polygon, Unichain, Avalanche, and Telos. And it doesn't stop at minting.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:45.880
The built-in bridge lets you move tokens between chains, all from the same UI. No external

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:52.040
dApps required. The UNCX Token Minter is now live, redefining what token launch infrastructure

00:00:52.040 --> 00:00:52.480
looks like.
